<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SafeSphere - Enterprise Flood Risk & Supply Chain Radar System</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- FontAwesome for Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & Sarabun -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#eef6ff',
              100: '#e0f0fe',
              500: '#0284c7',
              600: '#0369a1',
              700: '#075985',
              800: '#0c4a6e',
              900: '#082f49',
            },
            risk: {
              low: '#10b981',
              medium: '#f59e0b',
              high: '#ef4444',
            }
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Sarabun', 'Inter', 'sans-serif'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b1120;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }
    
    /* Radar Ping Animation */
    @keyframes radar-sweep {
      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }
    .radar-sweeper {
      animation: radar-sweep 4s linear infinite;
      transform-origin: center;
    }

    @keyframes pulse-ring {
      0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 0.3; }
      100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
    }
    .pulse-danger {
      animation: pulse-ring 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #1e293b;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #475569;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #64748b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-slate-950">

  <!-- TOP APP BAR / HEADER -->
  <header class="bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 sticky top-0 z-40 shadow-xl">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
        
        <!-- Logo & Title -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 via-cyan-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/30">
            <i class="fa-solid font-bold fa-shield-halved"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
              <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">SafeSphere</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-purple-950 text-purple-300 border border-purple-700/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-yellow-400"></i> ENTERPRISE
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">Multi-Facility Industrial Risk & Supply Chain Continuity Platform</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- System Controls & Facility Switcher -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 sm:space-x-4">
          <!-- Multi-Facility Selector -->
          <div class="hidden md:flex items-center bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap text-purple-400 mr-2 text-xs"></i>
            <select id="facilitySelect" onchange="changeFacility(this.value)" class="bg-transparent text-xs text-slate-200 font-medium focus:outline-none cursor-pointer">
              <option value="f1" selected>สำนักงานใหญ่ - นิคมฯ อมตะซิตี้ #4 (ระยอง)</option>
              <option value="f2">สาขา 2 - นิคมฯ บางปะอิน (พระนครศรีอยุธยา)</option>
              <option value="f3">ศูนย์กระจายสินค้า - บางนา กม.19 (สมุทรปราการ)</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- Notification Status Switch -->
          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 space-x-2">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">เตือนภัยอัตโนมัติ:</span>
            <button id="toggleAutoNotifyBtn" onclick="toggleAutoNotification()" class="relative inline-flex h-5 w-10 flex-shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-transparent bg-emerald-500 transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none">
              <span id="autoNotifyDot" class="pointer-events-none inline-block h-4 w-4 transform rounded-full bg-white shadow ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out translate-x-5"></span>
            </button>
            <span id="autoNotifyStatusText" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400">เปิดอยู่</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Test Alert Trigger Button -->
          <button onclick="openNotificationModal()" class="bg-amber-500/20 hover:bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium flex items-center space-x-1.5 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bell animate-bounce text-amber-400"></i>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline">ทดสอบส่งสัญญาณ</span>
          </button>

          <!-- Factory Info Modal Trigger -->
          <button onclick="openFactoryModal()" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium flex items-center space-x-2 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-industry text-cyan-400"></i>
            <span id="headerFactoryName" class="hidden xl:inline">อมตะซิตี้ #4</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-gear text-slate-400"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- NAVIGATION TABS BAR -->
  <nav class="bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800/80 sticky top-16 z-30 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex space-x-1 overflow-x-auto py-2 no-scrollbar scroll-smooth">
        <button onclick="switchTab('dashboard')" id="tab-btn-dashboard" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap bg-cyan-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-cyan-600/30">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high mr-2"></i>ภาพรวมระบบ (Dashboard)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('disaster-map')" id="tab-btn-disaster-map" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot mr-2 text-rose-400"></i>แผนที่ภัยพิบัติ (Disaster Map)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('what-if')" id="tab-btn-what-if" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders mr-2 text-indigo-400"></i>จำลองสถานการณ์ (What-If)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('rescue')" id="tab-btn-rescue" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-ramp-box mr-2 text-amber-400"></i>จัดลำดับย้ายของ (Rescue Priority)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('supply-chain')" id="tab-btn-supply-chain" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 relative">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project mr-2 text-teal-400"></i>เรดาร์ซัพพลายเชน (Supply Chain)
          <span class="ml-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 text-[10px] rounded-full border border-teal-500/40">Enterprise</span>
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('ledger')" id="tab-btn-ledger" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar mr-2 text-emerald-400"></i>บัญชีเคลม (Loss Ledger)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('scorecard')" id="tab-btn-scorecard" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie mr-2 text-purple-400"></i>คะแนนความพร้อม (Resilience)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('pricing')" id="tab-btn-pricing" class="nav-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition whitespace-nowrap text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 border border-cyan-500/30">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-crown mr-2 text-yellow-400"></i>แพ็กเกจ & ROI Calculator
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT CONTAINER -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 flex-grow w-full">

    <!-- REAL-TIME STATUS BANNER -->
    <div class="mb-6 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-40 h-40 bg-rose-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <!-- Current Level Indicator -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
          <div id="riskLevelBadgeIcon" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-2xl shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation animate-pulse"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">ระดับความเสี่ยงปัจจุบัน:</span>
              <span id="riskLevelBadgeText" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">เฝ้าระวัง (Moderate Risk)</span>
            </div>
            <h2 id="riskStatusHeading" class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-0.5">มวลน้ำจากเขื่อนหลักไหลลงสู่ลำน้ำสาขา - ระดับน้ำคลองรอบนิคมฯ +45 ซม.</h2>
            <p id="riskStatusDesc" class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">คาดการณ์ระดับมวลน้ำเข้าถึงขอบคันกั้นโรงงานภายใน <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">18 ชั่วโมง 45 นาที</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Emergency Action Trigger -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 w-full md:w-auto justify-end border-t md:border-t-0 border-slate-800 pt-3 md:pt-0">
          <div class="text-right hidden xl:block">
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">ประเมินมูลค่าทรัพย์สินเสี่ยงสูง</p>
            <p id="totalRiskValueSummary" class="text-base font-bold text-rose-400">฿ 34,500,000</p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="switchTab('rescue')" class="w-full md:w-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-amber-600 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-amber-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-rose-900/30 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i>
            <span>เริ่มแผนอพยพทรัพย์สินด่วน</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 1: DASHBOARD -->
    <section id="sec-dashboard" class="tab-content space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Metrics Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">ระดับน้ำเขื่อนหลักใกล้เคียง</span>
            <span class="p-2 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 rounded-lg text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-water"></i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">84.2%</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-rose-400 ml-2 font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i> +3.1% จากเมื่อวาน</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">อ่างเก็บน้ำกิ่วลม / หนองปลาไหล</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">เวลาเตรียมการที่เหลือ (Time-to-Impact)</span>
            <span class="p-2 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 rounded-lg text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400">18 ชม. 45 นาที</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">ก่อนมวลน้ำแตะคันกั้นดิน A2</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">สถานะห่วงโซ่อุปทาน (Enterprise)</span>
            <span class="p-2 bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 rounded-lg text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2">
            <span id="statSupplierRiskCount" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">2 / 5 ราย</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-rose-400 ml-2 font-medium">ติดขัดเส้นทาง</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">สต็อกสำรองเฉลี่ยรวม: 18 วัน</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">คะแนนความพร้อมองค์กร (Resilience)</span>
            <span class="p-2 bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 rounded-lg text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat"></i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-300">88 / 100</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 ml-2 font-medium">ระดับ A (พร้อมดีมาก)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Enterprise Standard Verified</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Action Widgets Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Quick Disaster Map Preview -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-rose-400 mr-2"></i>
                เรดาร์ภัยพิบัติรอบพื้นที่โรงงาน
              </h3>
              <button onclick="switchTab('disaster-map')" class="text-xs text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 font-medium">ขยายแผนที่เต็ม <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="relative w-full h-64 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#1e293b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px] opacity-60"></div>
              
              <!-- Radar Sweep -->
              <div class="absolute w-80 h-80 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/20"></div>
              <div class="absolute w-52 h-52 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30"></div>
              <div class="absolute w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/40"></div>
              
              <!-- Flood Risk Zone Contour -->
              <div class="absolute top-4 right-10 w-48 h-36 bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/40 rounded-full blur-sm pulse-danger"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-12 w-40 h-28 bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 rounded-full blur-sm"></div>

              <!-- Factory Icon Pin (Center) -->
              <div class="absolute z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 text-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/50 ring-4 ring-cyan-500/30">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-industry"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-slate-900/90 text-cyan-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-cyan-800 mt-1">โรงงานหลัก</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Threat pin -->
              <div class="absolute top-10 right-20 z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-rose-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-lg animate-bounce">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-water"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[9px] bg-rose-950 text-rose-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-800 mt-1">มวลน้ำหลัก (+45cm)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 bg-slate-950/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/80">
            <span class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-rose-500 text-[8px] mr-1.5"></i>โซนเสี่ยงสูง (ท่วมแน่ใน 24 ชม.)</span>
            <span class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-amber-500 text-[8px] mr-1.5"></i>โซนเฝ้าระวัง</span>
            <span class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-emerald-500 text-[8px] mr-1.5"></i>โซนปลอดภัย</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Recent Notification Logs Widget -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left text-amber-400 mr-2"></i>
                ประวัติการแจ้งเตือนอัตโนมัติ
              </h3>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Enterprise Sync</span>
            </div>

            <div id="notificationLogList" class="space-y-3 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
              <div class="p-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 text-xs space-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="font-bold text-amber-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-1"></i> ระดับเฝ้าระวัง (Watch)</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">10 นาทีที่แล้ว</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300">ส่ง Email, SMS และ Voice Call อัตโนมัติถึง CEO และผู้จัดการโรงงานเรียบร้อยแล้ว</p>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex items-center space-x-2 pt-1">
                  <span><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-cyan-400"></i> Email: สำเร็จ (4)</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-purple-400"></i> Voice Call: รับสาย (2)</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 text-xs space-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="font-bold text-cyan-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1"></i> รายงานประจำวัน</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">08:00 น.</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300">สรุปคะแนนความพร้อม Resilience Scorecard (88/100) ส่งผู้บริหารแล้ว</p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 text-xs space-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle mr-1"></i> ระบบซิงค์ข้อมูล</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">เมื่อวานนี้</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300">เชื่อมต่อ API ThaiWater & GISTDA เพื่ออัปเดตระดับน้ำแม่น้ำป่าสักสำเร็จ</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button onclick="openNotificationModal()" class="mt-4 w-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs py-2 rounded-xl transition font-medium text-center">
            ส่งการแจ้งเตือนด้วยตนเอง / ทดสอบส่งสัญญาณ
          </button>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

